OL,3,GNEWSASatellite images reveal scale of
OL,4,Areservoirs' decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew satellite images reveal the scale
OL,7,Fof reservoirs' reduction across the
OL,8,Fsouth-west of England.
OL,10,FWimbleball Lake on Exmoor in Somerset,
OL,11,Fwhich provides drinking water to about
OL,12,F400,000 people in Devon, was full in
OL,13,FMarch 2026 but by October reached as
OL,14,Flow as 13% of capacity, and was named
OL,15,Fby the Environment Agency as
OL,16,F"exceptionally low".
OL,18,FAn old Victorian bridge underneath
OL,19,FWimbleball Lake has even resurfaced due
OL,20,Fto prolonged dry weather as a severe
OL,21,Fdrought has been declared in the area.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
