OL,3,GNEWSASatellite images reveal scale of
OL,4,Areservoirs' decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new reservoir is being built in
OL,7,FCheddar, but it could take almost a
OL,8,Fdecade for it to come into use, with
OL,9,Fexperts warning people's water usage
OL,10,Fhas to change in the short term.
